
Rige by: ['sum'] dwaan: {
	>> total := 0.
	sels elk: { :index :element
		total optelle: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Rige ← 9 ; 8 ; 7.
Utfier skriuwe: (a sum), nije-rigel. 
>> a := Rige ← 1 ; 9.
Utfier skriuwe: (a sum), nije-rigel. 
>> a := Rige ← ['o'] ; 2.
Utfier skriuwe: (a sum), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (Rige nĳ sum), nije-rigel. 
